# Keeps your own files and the notes built from them out of any git repo you make from this folder.
# Only the starter files (skills, templates, guides and the About notes) are meant to be shared.
# Index.md, Preferences.md, Voice.md, Ideas.md, Topic radar.md, Topic backlog.md, Already said.md,
# Seen.md and Leads.md ship blank but fill up with your details,
# so they are ignored too. A public copy of the starter adds the blank versions with git add -f.

# Your files
Inbox/*
!Inbox/About inbox.md

# Notes the build writes about you
# Anchored with a leading slash so Templates/Profile.md, Templates/Index.md and Templates/Build log.md still ship.
/Profile.md
/Build log.md
/Index.md
/Old builds/
Sources/*
!Sources/About sources.md
Roles/*
!Roles/About roles.md
Employers/*
!Employers/About employers.md
Achievements/*
!Achievements/About achievements.md
Skills/*
!Skills/About skills.md
Stories/*
!Stories/About stories.md
Themes/*
!Themes/About themes.md
Education/*
!Education/About education.md
Certifications/*
!Certifications/About certifications.md
Recommendations/*
!Recommendations/About recommendations.md
Gaps/*
!Gaps/About gaps.md

# CVs, board memos and LinkedIn posts made for you
Targets/*
!Targets/About targets.md
LinkedIn/Drafts/*
!LinkedIn/Drafts/About*.md
LinkedIn/Posted/*
!LinkedIn/Posted/About*.md
LinkedIn/Voice.md
LinkedIn/Ideas.md
LinkedIn/Topic radar.md
LinkedIn/Topic backlog.md
LinkedIn/Already said.md
LinkedIn/run-linkedin-scan.cmd
LinkedIn/scan-log.txt

# Job Scout results and your preferences
Job Scout/Shortlists/*
!Job Scout/Shortlists/About shortlists.md
Job Scout/Preferences.md
Job Scout/Seen.md
Job Scout/Leads.md
Job Scout/run-scout.cmd
scout-log.txt

# Local settings and computer junk
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
